{"articleNo":"63910","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=63910&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"의사 순회진료 안내(2012-2학기)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.05","hit":"4364","attachments":[{"name":"2012-2학기의사순회진료.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=63910&attachNo=71930"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">우리대학교 학생 및 교직원의 보건 의료서비스를 위하여 다음과 같이 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">전문의사 진료를 실시하오니 투약, 건강상담 및 치료를 위하여 많은</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">이용 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">1. 진료구분</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">◈ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">순천향대학교 구미병원 순회진료 (매주 목요일)</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">진료과목 : 외과, 정형외과, 내과(소화기, 신장), 산부인과&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">◈ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">메리디안 한의원 , 배 한의원 순회진료 (매주 화요일)</span></u></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">2. 진료대상 : 학생 및 교직원</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">3.<strong> 진료장소 : 교내 의무실(학생회관 103호)</strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">4. 예약자를 우선적으로 진료권 부여 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">- 예약장소 : 의무실(<strong>교내 ☎7119) </strong></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">5. 순천향대학교 구미병원 : 입원 및 종합검진시 할인혜택 가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">6. 한의원 : 첩약복용시 10% 할인혜택 가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">7. 기타 자세한 문의사항은 의무실(교내 ☎7119)로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">학 생 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
